      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Portraius Studio: the Video studio\n\n**Text (top row).** Seedance 2.5, the app's default for video without people: a 480p draft first. Copy the draft_task_id from \"Preview as Text\" into \"Seedance 2.5 final\", turn it and its Save Video on (Ctrl+B), and run again for the 1080p final.\n\n**Use references (middle row).** The \"Product reveal\" preset with an element's sheet as {product}. Any cast in references mode renders on MiniMax H3 in the app, because Seedance refuses photoreal people, so this does too. Put the sheet in as `satchel-sheet.jpg`.\n\n**Animate an image (bottom row).** A frame with a face goes to MiniMax H3. A frame without people goes to Seedance 2.5 instead: see the second row of still-first-video. Put the frame in as `walt-diner.jpg`.\n\nNeeds a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Portraius Studio: the Video studio\n\n**Text (top row).** Seedance 2.5, the app's default for video without people: a 480p draft first. Copy the draft_task_id from \"Preview as Text\" into \"Seedance 2.5 final\", turn it and its Save Video on (Ctrl+B), and run again for the 1080p final.\n\n**Use references (middle row).** The \"Product reveal\" preset with an element's sheet as {product}. Any cast in references mode renders on MiniMax H3 in the app, because Seedance refuses photoreal people, so this does too. Put the sheet in as `satchel-sheet.jpg`.\n\n**Animate an image (bottom row).** A frame with a face goes to MiniMax H3. A frame without people goes to Seedance 2.5 instead: see the second row of still-first-video. Put the frame in as `walt-diner.jpg`.\n\nNeeds a Comfy account with credits: these are partner nodes."
      }
    },
